  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Harwich Chamber of Commerce</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4461 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-art-and-community tag-artweekma tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce\" id=\"post-4461\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/community-painting-unveiling/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman putting paintings\" src=\"/media/archive/bf9d7f2cbfceffbddc3644287761deb1e4e620a6f0013cf8ab647e814b7c548d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/community-painting-unveiling/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Community Painting Unveiling</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T21:50:20-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 9:50 pm\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists will unveil the Mystery Painting Puzzle at 4:30 pm, Saturday June 29th at the Harwich Chamber of Commerce Welcome Center in Harwich Port.  </p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3761 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-artweekma tag-donna-julian-spillane tag-doris-mee tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-meet-the-artist tag-robin-litwin tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" alt=\"A blank white image.\" src=\"/media/archive/756fb9062dc3b8319cf9143d170258ae733c4c39396c5a3879bbaaf72f244534.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-01T01:21:11-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 1, 2018, 1:21 am\">May 1, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>At the Guild meeting on April 21, members voted and approved of by-law changes which included: Guild membership is expanded to include residents or taxpayers of Barnstable County A “quorum” <a href=\"/news/may-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3752 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-toast-of-harwich tag-wequassett\" id=\"post-3752\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"838\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a group of people dancing.\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">17th Annual Toast of Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and <a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3391 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-harwich-artists tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-monthly-meetings tag-peter-kalill\" id=\"post-3391\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/january-demonstrator-peter-kalill/\" rel=\"bookmark\">January Demonstrator, Peter Kalill</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-02T00:55:35-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, January 2, 2018, 12:55 am\">January 2, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Peter Kalill will demonstrate his oil painting technique for the Guild of Harwich Artists at their January meeting.  The meeting will be held Saturday, January 20, 2018, at 2:00p.m. at <a href=\"/news/january-demonstrator-peter-kalill/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2312 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-harwich-port tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-2312\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/gallerys-10th-season-begins-april-1/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"643\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A small house with a flag on the front porch, located in the artist's guild district of Harwich.\" src=\"/media/archive/463b9501a8b79c6df955694259b56ae8b4b921e54b5cd3a59354c9c540b16989.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/gallerys-10th-season-begins-april-1/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Gallery’s 10th Season Begins April 1</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-03-29T16:46:19-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, March 29, 2017, 4:46 pm\">March 29, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists opens their 10th Season April 1, 2017. Gallery is only open weekends during April.  Saturday 10-5 and Sunday 12 – 4. Gallery is <a href=\"/news/gallerys-10th-season-begins-april-1/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
